    "description": "This dataset contains multibeam sonar bathymetry and magnetometer survey data collected from the research vessel L'Atalante in the Caribbean Sea and North Atlantic Ocean. Cruise HAITI-SIS was carried out from 10th December to 23rd 2012 between Port-au-Prince and Fort de France onboard the research vessel L\u00e2\u0080\u0099Atalante. Its aim was geophysical mapping of the northern Caribbean region including the Turk and Caicos. This is MSR RATS cruise U2012-030.  These data are part of the World Data Services for Geophysics. Cruise report is in PDF, data are in text, PDF, binary, and postscript formats.",
